  "description": "NetOpenGrid: server-rendered HTML data grid for ASP.NET Core (.NET 10) powered by HTMX + Alpine.js. Precompiled delegates (no reflection on the hot path), Excel-style filters with value counts, pinned and reorderable columns, nested grouping, server-side CSV export, i18n and embedded assets. This meta-package references NetOpenGrid.Infrastructure, NetOpenGrid.Application and NetOpenGrid.Domain. Add NetOpenGrid.Persistence.EFCore for an EF Core data source.",
